---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<SiteLayout title="Professional Overthinkers — Britt Joosten">
  <main class="overthinkers-page">
    <a class="overthinkers-back" href="/projects/">← Projects &amp; Works</a>

    <article class="overthinkers-content">
      <header class="overthinkers-header">
        <h1>Professional Overthinkers</h1>
      </header>

      <section class="overthinkers-intro" aria-label="Project overview">
        <img
          class="overthinkers-hero-image"
          src="/images/PXL_20230604_103545450.jpg"
          alt="Professional Overthinkers garment in its urban setting"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <dl class="overthinkers-metadata">
          <div>
            <dt>Timeline</dt>
            <dd>Feb. 2023 – Jun. 2023</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Project type</dt>
            <dd>Individual project</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Tools &amp; software</dt>
            <dd>SolidWorks / Adobe Illustrator / Adobe InDesign / Silhouette</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Key skills</dt>
            <dd>User Research / Concept Development / Textile Techniques / Pattern Making / Interaction Design</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="overthinkers-story" aria-label="About the project">
        <div class="overthinkers-copy">
          <div>
            <p>
              For many young adults aged 18–25, reaching for a smartphone has become a familiar way
              to escape negative thoughts and overwhelming emotions. While scrolling can provide
              temporary distraction, it does not address the underlying thought patterns.
              Professional Overthinkers explores how streetwear can make mindfulness and positive
              mind training more approachable, offering an alternative to habitual digital
              escapism.
            </p>
            <p>
              Following a user-centred approach informed by the Double Diamond methodology, I
              conducted interviews with users and experts and developed and prototyped concepts
              using a range of textile techniques. These insights informed a streetwear-inspired
              garment designed to resonate with a younger audience and challenge the stigma
              surrounding mindfulness.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>
              The garment features a pocket positioned at the front that integrates NFC technology.
              By flipping the pocket over their head, the wearer activates an audio guide with
              evidence-informed positive mind training and mindfulness exercises. This physical
              interaction creates a moment of separation from the smartphone to focus on their
              thoughts. Through repeated use, the garment aims to become a familiar cue to pause and
              put the phone aside, eventually serving as a reminder without the need for guidance.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rather than simply replacing scrolling with another distraction, Professional
              Overthinkers aims to help young adults gradually become more comfortable with their
              own thoughts.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a
                class="overthinkers-video-link"
                href="/videos/fbp%20vid.mp4"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
              >Video</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img
          class="overthinkers-story-image"
          src="/images/PO pocket.png"
          alt="Close view of the garment’s NFC pocket interaction"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </section>
    </article>

    <div class="overthinkers-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="overthinkers-process">
      <section class="overthinkers-process-section" aria-labelledby="overthinkers-concept-heading">
        <h2 id="overthinkers-concept-heading">Concept exploration</h2>
        <div class="overthinkers-concept-gallery">
          <img
            src="/images/diagrem.png"
            alt="Concept diagram showing the development toward the Professional Overthinkers garment"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20261119_132827171.jpg"
            alt="Early garment and pocket placement exploration"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20261119_132839648.jpg"
            alt="Textile construction and sewing exploration"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="overthinkers-process-section" aria-labelledby="overthinkers-material-heading">
        <h2 id="overthinkers-material-heading">Material exploration</h2>
        <div class="overthinkers-material-gallery">
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20230614_091211944.jpg"
            alt="Textile swatch with notes from material exploration"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20230614_091406574.jpg"
            alt="Material and textile technique samples"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20230615_145256911.jpg"
            alt="Garment concept sketches in a notebook"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="overthinkers-process-section" aria-labelledby="overthinkers-prototype-heading">
        <h2 id="overthinkers-prototype-heading">Prototyping &amp; testing</h2>
        <div class="overthinkers-prototype-gallery">
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20230516_173736183.jpg"
            alt="Fabric prototype laid out for construction"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/PXL_20230525_174852039.jpg"
            alt="Wearable garment prototype with integrated pocket"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="prototype-stacked-pair">
            <img
              src="/images/color options po.png"
              alt="Color and garment options for Professional Overthinkers"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/PXL_20230528_073458301.MP.jpg"
              alt="Machine stitching detail on fabric"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <img
            src="/images/Poster Po.png"
            alt="Professional Overthinkers poster design"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
  html:has(.overthinkers-page),
  body:has(.overthinkers-page) {
    height: auto;
    min-height: 100%;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .overthinkers-page {
    --overthinkers-navy: #172332;
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: 1px 0 4rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--overthinkers-navy);
    font-family: 'Avenir', Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .overthinkers-back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: 2rem;
    z-index: 2;
    color: var(--overthinkers-navy);
    font-family: 'Vipnagorgialla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .overthinkers-back:hover,
  .overthinkers-back:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  .overthinkers-content,
  .overthinkers-process {
    width: min(64%, 980px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .overthinkers-content {
    padding-top: clamp(6.5rem, 12vh, 9.5rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-header h1,
  .overthinkers-process-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--overthinkers-navy);
    font-family: 'Vipnagorgialla', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .overthinkers-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.75vw, 2.85rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(16rem, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-hero-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .overthinkers-metadata {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(0.85rem, 1.3vw, 1.25rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .overthinkers-metadata dt {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 0.78vw, 0.85rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .overthinkers-metadata dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 0.8vw, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .overthinkers-story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(14rem, 0.85fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 4rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 4rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-copy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 1.8vw, 1.75rem);
    font-size: clamp(0.76rem, 0.8vw, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .overthinkers-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .overthinkers-video-link {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .overthinkers-story-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .overthinkers-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(0.65rem, 0.9vw, 0.95rem);
    background: #192331;
  }

  .overthinkers-process {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-process-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-process-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .overthinkers-process-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.1vw, 2.2rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-concept-gallery,
  .overthinkers-material-gallery {
    display: grid;
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-concept-gallery {
    grid-template-columns: 1.04fr 0.81fr 0.81fr;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .overthinkers-material-gallery {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .overthinkers-material-gallery img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.78;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .overthinkers-concept-gallery img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .overthinkers-concept-gallery img:nth-child(2),
  .overthinkers-concept-gallery img:nth-child(3) {
    aspect-ratio: 0.78;
  }

  .overthinkers-concept-gallery img:first-child {
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    object-fit: fill;
  }

  .overthinkers-material-gallery img:nth-child(3) {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .overthinkers-prototype-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    align-items: end;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .overthinkers-prototype-gallery > img:nth-child(1),
  .overthinkers-prototype-gallery > img:nth-child(2) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.72;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .prototype-stacked-pair {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 1rem);
  }

  .prototype-stacked-pair img:first-child {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .prototype-stacked-pair img:last-child {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1.45;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .overthinkers-prototype-gallery > img:last-child {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 0.8;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .overthinkers-content,
    .overthinkers-process {
      width: min(86%, 760px);
    }

    .overthinkers-content {
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-intro {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-story {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, 0.75fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-prototype-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .overthinkers-page {
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-back {
      top: 1.25rem;
      left: 1.15rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-content,
    .overthinkers-process {
      width: calc(100% - 2.25rem);
    }

    .overthinkers-content {
      padding-top: 4.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-header h1 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 8vw, 2.8rem);
    }

    .overthinkers-intro,
    .overthinkers-story {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .overthinkers-intro {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-metadata {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-metadata dt {
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-metadata dd {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .overthinkers-story {
      gap: 0;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-story-image {
      width: min(100%, 28rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .overthinkers-process {
      padding-top: 3rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-process-section {
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .overthinkers-process-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 6vw, 2rem);
    }

    .overthinkers-concept-gallery,
    .overthinkers-material-gallery,
    .overthinkers-prototype-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
